&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed security tools, practices, and processes into the CI/CD pipeline to ensure code quality and security,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and manage security measures in infrastructure as code (IaC) solutions such as Terraform,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage in solving real business problems by exploring and building an efficient and scalable infrastructure,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and assess security risks, vulnerabilities, and threats; propose mitigation strategies,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with relevant security standards and regulations (e.g., GDPR, ISO 27001, NIST),&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain thorough documentation of security practices, processes, and incident response activities,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive your decisions on data and metrics, constantly measure and enhance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
