&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in a DevSecOps, DevOps, or Security Engineering role,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in scripting languages (e.g., Python, Bash), and familiarity with CI/CD tools (e.g., Jenkins, GitLab CI, GitHub Actions).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of cloud security principles and experience with AWS, Azure, or Google Cloud,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with containerization (Docker, Kubernetes) and securing containerized applications,&lt;/li&gt;
