&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a seasoned &lt;strong&gt;Director of Sales &lt;/strong&gt;to architect and execute LivePerson’s North American enterprise strategy, focusing on high-velocity growth within the Fortune 500. You will be responsible for the end-to-end performance of your team, from identifying&amp;nbsp; top-tier talent and accelerating &quot;ramp-to-quota&quot; to serving as the executive sponsor on marquee digital transformation deals. This role requires a data-driven leader who can navigate complex procurement hurdles while fostering a relentless &quot;hunter&quot; mindset across a collaborative, customer-obsessed organization.&lt;/p&gt;
