&lt;li&gt;Architect high-opportunity clusters across North America, ensuring AE portfolios are balanced for optimal &quot;Land and Expand&quot; potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in strategic deal reviews to help AEs navigate the complex stakeholder maps and procurement hurdles typical of multi-million dollar enterprise contracts.&lt;/li&gt;
