&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Google Partner Sales Lead&lt;/strong&gt; is a high-impact, revenue-generating role designed for a professional with a hunter mentality and a strategic mindset. You will act as the primary engine for driving sales, strategy, and business development through our alliance with Google Cloud. This is not just a relationship role; it is a sales oriented role responsible for identifying and driving new Google-sourced pipeline, assisting the field sales team with closing complex opportunities via the Google Marketplace, and maximising the financial benefits of the partnership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will: Key Responsibilities &amp;amp; Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Revenue &amp;amp; Pipeline (The Hunter Focus)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
