&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and support existing products within the Echo ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure high availability, performance, and reliability of platform services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, monitor, and improve SLOs, SLIs, and error budgets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify system risks and implement reliability improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in incident response, troubleshooting, and post-incident reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud &amp;amp; Kubernetes (GKE)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
