&lt;p&gt;Job Description: Senior Software Engineer (Java, Python, Cloud Native, Generative AI) - 8+ Years Experience from a Product Based IT Company&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Overview:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a highly motivated and experienced Senior Java Engineer to join our engineering team. In this high-impact role, you will own the design and implementation of significant portions of our product development, specifically working with our Bots &amp;amp; Automation team to build a next-generation bot runtime platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will serve as a technical leader and mentor for a small team of engineers, driving best practices in distributed systems and software architecture. If you have a passion for building reliable, scalable, and high-performance services and possess exceptional technical expertise, we want to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership &amp;amp; System Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the design and implementation of critical backend components. You will build high-volume, low-latency applications for mission-critical systems, ensuring high availability and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Next-Gen Platform Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate closely with the Bots &amp;amp; Automation team to architect and build a next-generation bot runtime platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Distributed Systems Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Create reliable, scalable, and high-performance services. Your work will require a deep understanding of Computer Science fundamentals and practical experience building large-scale distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;API Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and develop secure, scalable REST-based backend services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as a leader and mentor to other engineers, fostering a culture of technical excellence and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Debug production issues, maintain existing codebases, and ensure the stability of the platform. You will participate in on-call rotations to support mission-critical services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documentation &amp;amp; Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop technical specifications, architecture documentation, and ensure all software complies with strict security standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Qualification:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, or a related field (or equivalent experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of Data Structures and Algorithm Design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills in Java with good knowledge of multi-threading.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level knowledge of Databases (SQL, NoSQL) like Cassandra, MySQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Data Processing frameworks like Kafka, Airflow, Apache Spark, Hadoop&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building REST APIs and debugging distributed microservice-based applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Git, Jenkins, and other Development tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with NodeJS &amp;amp; Python is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud expertise in either Google Cloud Platform (GCP) or Amazon Web Services (AWS)&lt;/li&gt;
